      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The pain you feel is a natural response to loss, but it doesn't mean your story has to end; it just means you are in a difficult chapter right now. Many people find that their sense of purpose shifts rather than disappears, allowing them to discover new depths of meaning that weren't possible before. Please consider speaking with a mental health professional who can help you navigate this emotional transition and find new ways to feel alive.",
      "source": "target",
